    "Baixe o outro app só da loja oficial. Nunca digite as palavras num site nem as mande a ninguém: quem oferece recuperar saldo quer o saldo." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Download the other app only from the official store. Never type the words on a website or send them to anyone: whoever offers to recover a balance wants the balance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
