    "Enquanto ela está aberta, o app não fala com rede nenhuma. A conferência é feita aqui: a última palavra traz uma soma de verificação das outras, calculada no iPhone com a lista de 2048 palavras que vem dentro do app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While it's open, the app talks to no network at all. The check happens here: the last word carries a checksum of the others, computed on the iPhone with the list of 2048 words that ships inside the app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enquanto não terminar, em Ordens abertas: pedido à CoW, grátis mas sem garantia, ou na rede, garantido, pagando taxa" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "حتى ينتهي، من الأوامر المفتوحة: طلب إلى CoW، مجاني لكن غير مضمون، أو على السلسلة، مضمون، مع رسوم"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bis sie fertig ist, unter „Offene Orders“: eine Anfrage an CoW, kostenlos, aber ohne Garantie, oder on-chain, garantiert, mit Gebühr"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Until it finishes, in Open orders: a request to CoW, free but not guaranteed, or on-chain, guaranteed, with a fee"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mientras no termine, en Órdenes abiertas: solicitud a CoW, gratis pero sin garantía, o en la red, garantizado, pagando comisión"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tant qu’il n’est pas terminé, dans Ordres ouverts : demande à CoW, gratuite mais sans garantie, ou on-chain, garantie, avec des frais"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "पूरा होने तक, खुले ऑर्डर में: CoW को अनुरोध, मुफ़्त पर गारंटी नहीं, या ऑन-चेन, गारंटीड, शुल्क के साथ"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Selama belum selesai, di Order terbuka: permintaan ke CoW, gratis tetapi tanpa jaminan, atau on-chain, dijamin, dengan biaya"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完了するまでは「未約定の注文」から：CoW への依頼（無料、保証なし）またはオンチェーン（保証あり、手数料あり）"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "완료될 때까지 미체결 주문에서: CoW에 요청(무료지만 보장 없음) 또는 온체인(보장됨, 수수료 있음)"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bitene kadar Açık emirler bölümünden: CoW'a istek (ücretsiz ama garantisiz) ya da zincir üstünde (garantili, ücretli)"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cho đến khi hoàn tất, trong Lệnh đang mở: gửi yêu cầu đến CoW, miễn phí nhưng không bảo đảm, hoặc trên chuỗi, có bảo đảm, mất phí"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完成前，可在“未完成订单”中取消：向 CoW 发送请求（免费但不保证），或在链上取消（有保证，需支付手续费）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
