    "O %@ não está disponível agora. Confira se ele está ligado para a Escalibur em Ajustes do iPhone e tente de novo. Pelo Espelhamento do iPhone, isto não funciona." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ غير متاح الآن. تحقق من أنه مفعّل لـ Escalibur في إعدادات iPhone وحاول مجددًا. لا يعمل هذا عبر محاكاة iPhone."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ ist gerade nicht verfügbar. Prüfe, ob es in den iPhone-Einstellungen für Escalibur eingeschaltet ist, und versuche es noch einmal. Über die iPhone-Synchronisierung funktioniert das nicht."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ isn't available right now. Check that it's turned on for Escalibur in iPhone Settings and try again. This doesn't work through iPhone Mirroring."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
